      "id": "claim_899a446f04c6473d8d2deb148d0a1359",
      "statement": "The core packages have distinct responsibilities: deepagents is the SDK (create_deep_agent, middleware, backends), code is the prebuilt terminal coding agent run via dcode, acp is the Agent Client Protocol editor integration, evals is the evaluation suite with Harbor integration, talon is the experimental long-running host, and partners holds provider/sandbox integrations (Daytona, Modal, Runloop, Vercel, QuickJS).",
