      "statement": "Deep Agents is a three-layer stack: LangGraph is the runtime (state, checkpoints, streaming, interrupts), LangChain's create_agent is the agent abstraction (model + tools + middleware forming the agent loop), and Deep Agents is an opinionated harness on top of create_agent that does not introduce a new runtime.",
